{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50359","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十二、安城祆咏[二六] · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十二、安城祆咏[二六]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"版筑安城日，神祠与此兴。\n一州祈景祚，万类仰休徵。\n苹藻来（釆）无乏，精灵若有凭。\n更看云祭处，朝夕酒如绳（渑）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}